{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t尖沙咀香港文化中心上午發生火警，一名女職員受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n消防處表示，經調查後，該名女職員因觸電意外受傷，由救護員即場初步護理並送院治理。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n處方指，早上11時許接報，並於3分鐘後到場，發現火勢已熄滅，消防人員開喉戒備。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T06:59:01.013114+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:45:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T07:57:38.440819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T06:57:37.702536+00:00","content_hash":"bd56f5a1a378b1fb3c16186af22ffd47dcbfae00457c5754d50e3becd7d203c6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}